<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JAN-MAY TRADE DEFICIT $1.037 BLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JAN-MAY TRADE DEFICIT $1.037 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's foreign trade deficit</p>
<p>rose to $1.037 billion in May from $906.9 million in April,</p>
<p>according to preliminary figures from the Ministry of Industry,</p>
<p>Trade and Tourism on Wednesday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY TRADE DEFICIT  (in million dollars)</p>
<p>			  Jan-May 97  Jan-April 97   Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    Exports	    7,042	 5,420.9	   5,618</p>
<p>    Import	     8,079	 6,327.8	   6,552</p>
<p>    Trade balance   -1,037	  -906.9	    -934</p>
<p>NOTE - MIT data are based on customs statistics, while</p>
<p>National Bank of Hungary (NBH) trade figures are calculated</p>
<p>from cash flow data.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
